## Version 2.0.0

- Upgraded package compatibility from Optimizely CMS 12.x to Optimizely CMS 13.x.
- Reworked CMS integration points to use CMS 13 application APIs instead of site-definition APIs for route matching, static asset resolution, and category editor scoping.
- Dropped `net8.0` multi-targeting; the packages now target `net10.0` only.
- Refreshed NuGet lock files to align with the CMS 13 dependency graph and removed the explicit transitive security package pins carried in v1.
